<description>&lt;p&gt;Egypt reopened its embassy in Tripoli, restoring diplomatic ties after a 12-year gap and signaling a regional shift on Libya. ISIS militants killed a young Christian man in Libya after he refused to deny Jesus. Migrant vessels departing from Libya have suffered deadly shipwrecks off Crete, with at least 20 migrants killed in recent incidents. Libyan and Chadian foreign ministers signed the final document of the CEN-SAD Executive Council meeting. Combat intensity remains low, with 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE9DU1A1RDZfTHZpSkthYlNpN0dUb2FjSzR1THV5Tk80R3h6Qy1DNmg0WW90QmZHWnpCNk1KTkZMd1pjRkRmRzdZR2x5VFRtTG9YejVYRHBpRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNQ2J5eFJTT1ZnZWc3QmR2VDA4cmVQZEl6eDlCa2VoMW5VVVI3bE4yMm5tQ19yU1hQNmJwT1hUdXZLclR1VEs1dFdQWFpoNnlBc2ZzQ0xoT0xNZnRVTFFOUXFEN2wwRzhnWVdoTVA2RHlPeV84OVloWF9wNU5BcnBCZUdPNnJLNnh3QWR0WmtGMUdBWkE5SmlnS0c2NEtqdUV0Vmp4dkdxV09xZjF5c0RvdkdJY3ctbEdf?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ahram Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vanguard News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE1fM3hvNTJHLTBHRTF4TnBaTzM1Q2t4b2RnREdKUEFrWXF1LUpmamJhQXI4M252eGZ0TTRTQUV5NDFJSzk5cUowTGNKdHdqZ1c0TVc3WXp1NEs?oc=5&quot;&gt;TRT World&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNN1RnOEJkbERKWVhHcXc2NkV6c3RSWS1aVHk1SFhRZExUU3VkWWo3dnVXOFFsNDZxUWRYS2tha3M5Njl0QUVKNGktR3NITURSazV6bzVBazJvWDhDbGFzNHVWRnhjWlprclhoVnJzOXFWVjRyYTY4dU40dHBaZGpEako1NmtqLXBWY3BaV0hhaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;www.christiandaily.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a 